        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Ragnarok War, the world is destroyed, regenerated, and reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But just as the gods do, humans also believe that war is a cycle of destruction and renewal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the cycle of destruction and rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy finds a pocket watch and encounters a figure named Norne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norne doesn't remember much of her life, but when she meets the boy, time stops, and the clock starts ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >time begins to flow for another cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the meantime, the daily lives, challenges, and survival stories of girls from various groups are told, centered on the boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >centered around the boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[About the Coalition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*St. Rosemary's Academy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-standing academy founded by Rosemary. It was established for war orphans after the end of the Aether War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a rigorous entrance examination, the school has attracted many talented students and trains them based on the philosophy of “fighting for peace”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Paul Bosque</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vassal state of the Lucian Empire ruled by Julia. It once held autonomy, but was stripped of it after a failed rebellion by its ancestral lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is now under the Empire, but it is unknown how long its lord, Yulia, will listen to the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Shabin Zara Top</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alliance of profit-driven merchants with sophisticated technology. Most of its members are cheerful and flamboyant, and operate on the principle of mutual trust and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Forest of Melody</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A forest where spirits have gathered to form their own civilization in a place far removed from the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spirits hate fighting and love peace, and under the leadership of Tosa Mikoto, they have a powerful spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Republic of Larok</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nation that once led an etheric revolution that led to a global war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They lost the war and suffered great damage to their ecosystem, but are now working with St. Rosemary's Academy to educate people on the proper use of the aether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in cooperation with St. Rosemary's Academy. Most of its citizens recognize the wrongdoings of their country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gameplay]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Players form teams of up to 5 beautiful girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Each beautiful girl has 3 skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Players can draw (submit) as many cards as the number of surviving beauties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Efficiently organize skills to defeat opponents within a set number of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Collectible RPG genre with a variety of beautiful girls to acquire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Over 50 collectible bishoujo characters available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*High-quality cel animations for your ultimate skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Turn-based rules to overcome various stages through interaction between characters and their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A massive 10-hour storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*More than 10 subplots to explore the character's personality</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Ragnarok War, the world is destroyed, regenerated, and reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But just as the gods do, humans also believe that war is a cycle of destruction and renewal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the cycle of destruction and rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy finds a pocket watch and encounters a figure named Norne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norne doesn't remember much of her life, but when she meets the boy, time stops, and the clock starts ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >time begins to flow for another cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the meantime, the daily lives, challenges, and survival stories of girls from various groups are told, centered on the boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >centered around the boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[About the Coalition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*St. Rosemary's Academy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-standing academy founded by Rosemary. It was established for war orphans after the end of the Aether War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a rigorous entrance examination, the school has attracted many talented students and trains them based on the philosophy of “fighting for peace”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Paul Bosque</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vassal state of the Lucian Empire ruled by Julia. It once held autonomy, but was stripped of it after a failed rebellion by its ancestral lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is now under the Empire, but it is unknown how long its lord, Yulia, will listen to the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Shabin Zara Top</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alliance of profit-driven merchants with sophisticated technology. Most of its members are cheerful and flamboyant, and operate on the principle of mutual trust and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Forest of Melody</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A forest where spirits have gathered to form their own civilization in a place far removed from the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spirits hate fighting and love peace, and under the leadership of Tosa Mikoto, they have a powerful spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Republic of Larok</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nation that once led an etheric revolution that led to a global war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They lost the war and suffered great damage to their ecosystem, but are now working with St. Rosemary's Academy to educate people on the proper use of the aether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in cooperation with St. Rosemary's Academy. Most of its citizens recognize the wrongdoings of their country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gameplay]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Players form teams of up to 5 beautiful girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Each beautiful girl has 3 skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Players can draw (submit) as many cards as the number of surviving beauties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Efficiently organize skills to defeat opponents within a set number of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Collectible RPG genre with a variety of beautiful girls to acquire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Over 50 collectible bishoujo characters available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*High-quality cel animations for your ultimate skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Turn-based rules to overcome various stages through interaction between characters and their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A massive 10-hour storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*More than 10 subplots to explore the character's personality</p>",
